  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">20-A2I &#x2013; Integrated Grain Handling Project for rural communities in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives of the project are to improve livelihood in rural areas in Uganda by 1) creating employment opportunities within the grain sector especially for women and youth 2) by reducing food-waste within the grain sector and 3) increase yield of cereals. The supporting commercial objective is to create a number of village-based, commercially viable &#x201c;grain hubs&#x201d; by introducing and combining Danish technologies within grain handling, storage and milling with focus on affordable and flexible solutions, and it will further include payment solutions for improving access to credit and finance.</narrative>
  </description>
